<LanguageData>
  <!-- Research into magic -->
  <!--原中文: '魔法栽培', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'cultivation',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: cultivation-->
  <TM_PlantCultivation.label>魔法栽培</TM_PlantCultivation.label>
  <!--原中文: '研究植物学以了解如何培养具有与魔法属性的植物，并利用它们来补充长法力和制造魔法物品。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Invest research into botany to gain an understanding of how to cultivate plants with properties relevant to magic and use their resources to supplement or fuel the arcane arts.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Invest research into botany to gain an understanding of how to cultivate plants with properties relevant to magic and use their resources to supplement or fuel the arcane arts.-->
  <TM_PlantCultivation.description>研究植物学以了解如何培养具有与魔法属性的植物，并利用它们来补充长法力和制造魔法物品。</TM_PlantCultivation.description>
  <!--原中文: '魔法设施', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'arcane facilities',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: arcane facilities-->
  <TM_ArcaneConstruction.label>魔法设施</TM_ArcaneConstruction.label>
  <!--原中文: '允许研究各种设施和工作台，使创造独特的魔法物品和效果。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Opens research into various facilities and workbenches that enabled the creation of unique magical items and effects.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Opens research into various facilities and workbenches that enabled the creation of unique magical items and effects.-->
  <TM_ArcaneConstruction.description>允许研究各种设施和工作台，使创造独特的魔法物品和效果。</TM_ArcaneConstruction.description>
  <!--原中文: '魔法-基础', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'arcane fundamentals',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: arcane fundamentals-->
  <TM_ArcaneFundamentals.label>魔法-基础</TM_ArcaneFundamentals.label>
  <!--原中文: '关于魔法力量如何与物理和其他法师相联系的基础研究。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Basic research on how arcane power is linked to the physical realm and to other mages.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Basic research on how arcane power is linked to the physical realm and to other mages.-->
  <TM_ArcaneFundamentals.description>关于魔法力量如何与物理和其他法师相联系的基础研究。</TM_ArcaneFundamentals.description>
  <!--原中文: '魔法阵', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Magic Circle',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Magic Circle-->
  <TM_MagicCircle.label>魔法阵</TM_MagicCircle.label>
  <!--原中文: '研究的几何和对称的莱伊线，让魔法师结合他们的能量创造难以置信的效果。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Advanced research on the geometry and symmetry of ley lines that enables magic users to combine their energy to create incredible effects.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Advanced research on the geometry and symmetry of ley lines that enables magic users to combine their energy to create incredible effects.-->
  <TM_MagicCircle.description>研究的几何和对称的莱伊线，让魔法师结合他们的能量创造难以置信的效果。</TM_MagicCircle.description>
  <!--原中文: '允许建造一个传送门 - 一个魔法文明的巅峰造物，使瞬间移动变得可能.需要一个受过相关训练的奥术法师来激活传送门。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Allows the construction of a portal - a powerful artifact that enables instant travel between colonies.\n\nRequires an Arcane Mage trained in Gateways to activate.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Allows the construction of a portal - a powerful artifact that enables instant travel between colonies.\n\nRequires an Arcane Mage trained in Gateways to activate.-->
  <TM_Portals.description>允许建造一个传送门 - 一个魔法文明的巅峰造物，使瞬间移动变得可能.需要一个受过相关训练的奥术法师来激活传送门。</TM_Portals.description>
