  <TM_ArcaneForging.label>奥法锻造</TM_ArcaneForging.label>
  <!--原中文: '开发用奥术力量制作各种物品和设备的方法。这项研究的完成也将教会殖民地如何织造魔纹布，这是一种独特的魔法材料。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Develop the means of using arcane power to craft various items and equipment. Completion of this research will also reveal how to make Manaweave, a unique material that enhances arcane power.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Develop the means of using arcane power to craft various items and equipment. Completion of this research will also reveal how to make Manaweave, a unique material that enhances arcane power.-->
  <TM_ArcaneForging.description>开发用奥术力量制作各种物品和设备的方法。这项研究的完成也将教会殖民地如何织造魔纹布，这是一种独特的魔法材料。</TM_ArcaneForging.description>
  <!--原中文: '复制锻造', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Forge Replication',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Forge Replication-->
  <TM_ForgeReplication.label>复制锻造</TM_ForgeReplication.label>
  <!--原中文: '使用一种技术增强奥术锻造，该技术允许它从任何可加工物品中提取设计图并制作复制品。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Enhances the Arcane Forge with a technique that allows it to extract the design from any craftable item and duplicate it at the forge.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Enhances the Arcane Forge with a technique that allows it to extract the design from any craftable item and duplicate it at the forge.-->
  <TM_ForgeReplication.description>使用一种技术增强奥术锻造，该技术允许它从任何可加工物品中提取设计图并制作复制品。</TM_ForgeReplication.description>
