  <!--原中文: '允许建造附魔台以及打造初级的附魔宝石。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Enables construction of the gemcutting bench and the crafting of tier I enchanting gems.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Enables construction of the gemcutting bench and the crafting of tier I enchanting gems.-->
