  <!--原中文: '允许打造中级的附魔宝石。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Enables crafting to tier II enchanting gems.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Enables crafting to tier II enchanting gems.-->
  <TM_AdvancedEnchanting.description>允许打造中级的附魔宝石。</TM_AdvancedEnchanting.description>
