  <!--原中文: '允许打造高级的附魔宝石。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Enables crafting of tier III enchanting gems.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Enables crafting of tier III enchanting gems.-->
  <TM_ExpertEnchanting.description>允许打造高级的附魔宝石。</TM_ExpertEnchanting.description>
  <!--原中文: '傀儡学说', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'golem theory',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: golem theory-->
  <TM_GolemCraftRD.label>傀儡学说</TM_GolemCraftRD.label>
  <!--原中文: '傀儡工艺是一种附魔技术，它与被动强化不同，研究为主动操纵魔法附魔的理论。这项研究将发展成如何应用附魔创造神奇生物的概念。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Golem crafting is a brand of enchanting that diverges from passive enhancements and researches theories of manipulating magical enchantments for active purposes. This research will develop concepts of how to apply active enhancements to create magical creatures. This research enables construction of the stone and maharal golems at the stonecutter's table. The maharal golem can also be created at a crafting spot. Also enables additional upgrades for the Straw golem.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Golem crafting is a brand of enchanting that diverges from passive enhancements and researches theories of manipulating magical enchantments for active purposes. This research will develop concepts of how to apply active enhancements to create magical creatures. This research enables construction of the stone and maharal golems at the stonecutter's table. The maharal golem can also be created at a crafting spot. Also enables additional upgrades for the Straw golem.-->
  <TM_GolemCraftRD.description>傀儡工艺是一种附魔技术，它与被动强化不同，研究为主动操纵魔法附魔的理论。这项研究将发展成如何应用附魔创造神奇生物的概念。</TM_GolemCraftRD.description>
  <!--原中文: '空洞傀儡', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'hollow golem',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: hollow golem-->
  <TM_HollowGolemRD.label>空洞傀儡</TM_HollowGolemRD.label>
  <!--原中文: '一种研究如何用活跃的原始能量制作傀儡的神奇方法。制造这种傀儡需要奥术熔炉。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A magical approach to golem crafting which researches how to animate raw energy. Crafting this type of golem will require an arcane forge.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A magical approach to golem crafting which researches how to animate raw energy. Crafting this type of golem will require an arcane forge.-->
  <TM_HollowGolemRD.description>一种研究如何用活跃的原始能量制作傀儡的神奇方法。制造这种傀儡需要奥术熔炉。</TM_HollowGolemRD.description>
  <!--原中文: '空洞械器', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'hollow equipment',更新于2026-02-14-->
